BOGMAP 1
name The Kirkyard
briefing The crypt door opens tae the organ, they say.
briefing The organ needs air. The compressor is lockit
briefing in the plant room. The gravedigger has a brass key.
briefing Mind the graves. Dinnae let Auld Wullie see ye.
intro Yer uncle was the famous Tartan Tunneller,
intro famed for his non-stop boring.
intro Efter too mony Christmas Pudding Whiskies
intro he let slip that he once dug a secret tunnel
intro frae the kirk crypt intae Castle Bogle.
intro The Laird has Princess Ailsa. Tonight ye find it.
story kirkyard
